## 设计概要

### 放置位置

`packages/utils/src/http-retry.ts`，从 `packages/utils/src/index.ts` 导出。

理由：
- `pi-utils` 已经是共享基础设施包，有 `hook-fetch.ts`、`abortable.ts`、`async.ts`、`ptree.ts`（`combineSignals`）
- 所有消费者（coding-agent、pi-gateway、ai）都已依赖 `@oh-my-pi/pi-utils`
- 独立的 `CircuitBreaker` 在 `pi-gateway` 中（预防），这个是恢复（retry），不同关注点

### 核心设计选择

|问题|决策|
|---|---|
|函数 vs 类|纯函数 `retryFetch()` — 无状态，可组合|
|jitter 策略|full jitter（AWS 推荐）: `delay = uniform(0, cap)`，最抗 thundering herd|
|超时分离|per-attempt timeout 用 `AbortSignal.timeout` 传给 fetch；user cancellation 在循环边界检查；overall timeout 用 wall-clock 检查|
|幂等语义|默认只重试 GET/HEAD/OPTIONS/TRACE/PUT/DELETE；POST/PATCH 排除，除非调用方显式覆盖|
|响应透明|成功 → `response` 可读；非可重试状态 → `response` 返回（调用方处理 401/403）；所有重试用完 → `response` 返回（调用方看到最后的状态）；网络错误 → `error` 返回；取消/超时 → `error` 返回|
|body 泄漏防护|重试前 `await response.body?.cancel()` 释放上一个响应的 body|
|可观测性|`RetryEvent[]` 结构化 trace：每个 attempt 的 url/method/status/error/delay/attemptDurationMs/cumulativeDurationMs|

---

## 完整实现

```typescript
// packages/utils/src/http-retry.ts

import { abortableSleep } from "./abortable";

// ─── Retry Policy ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

const IDEMPOTENT_METHODS = new Set(["GET", "HEAD", "OPTIONS", "TRACE", "PUT", "DELETE"]);
const DEFAULT_RETRYABLE_STATUSES = new Set([429, 500, 502, 503, 504]);

export interface RetryPolicy {
  /** Max total HTTP attempts (including first). Default: 3. */
  maxAttempts: number;
  /** Base delay in ms. Default: 1_000. */
  baseDelayMs: number;
  /** Max delay cap in ms. Default: 30_000. */
  maxDelayMs: number;
  /**
   * Jitter factor 0–1. Default: 1 (full jitter).
   * Effective delay = backoff * (1 - jitter * random(0,1))
   */
  jitterFactor: number;
  /** Methods safe to retry. Default: GET, HEAD, OPTIONS, TRACE, PUT, DELETE. */
  retryableMethods: ReadonlySet<string>;
  /** Status codes that trigger retry. Default: 429, 500, 502, 503, 504. */
  retryableStatuses: ReadonlySet<number>;
  /** Retry on network-level errors? Default: true. */
  retryOnNetworkError: boolean;
  /** Per-attempt timeout in ms. 0 = no timeout. Default: 0. */
  timeoutMs: number;
  /** Overall wall-clock budget in ms. 0 = no budget. Default: 0. */
  overallTimeoutMs: number;
}

// ─── Retry Event ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

export interface RetryEvent {
  attempt: number;              // 1-based
  url: string;
  method: string;
  status?: number;              // undefined for network errors
  error?: string;               // defined for network errors
  delayMs: number;              // delay before next attempt (0 = last)
  attemptDurationMs: number;    // this attempt's round-trip time
  cumulativeDurationMs: number; // wall-clock since first attempt
}

// ─── Retry Result ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

